/**
 *
 * CreateVirtualCircuitWorkflow4 was created since we bumped the Major version of CreateVirtualCircuitWorkflow,
 * because we added and changed steps.
 *
 * NOTE: This logic DEPENDS on only having one CC in a virtual Circuit on a device!
 * This is because the way we look up ConfigSnippets is based on deviceId and virtualCircuitId.
 *
 * This workflow both creates and updates VirtualCircuits:
 *   If a VirtualCircuit has been removed from a device, this workflow will delete the config snippets.
 *   For other devices, the snippets will be updated.
 *
 * This workflow currently does not set the VirtualCircuit to Failed.
 *   If there is an unexpected exception, the workflow will exit but leave the VC in Provisioning.
 *   If the config is not pushed to/removed from the device, this workflow will continue running forever.
 */
